{"id":"vod_sn_38273","vodId":"38273","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"怪物弹珠新系列 路西法 反叛的堕天使","name_cn":"怪物弹珠新系列 路西法 反叛的堕天使","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/42e2a8e783a645e8e638744b7622bf7f.jpg"},"summary":"WEB动画《路西法 反叛的堕天使》是怪物弹珠2018年新系列动画。焰莲回到曾经住过的街道·神之原，感受到了违和感，他确实应该在这条街道住过，却对那时的事情没有记忆。此时，莲的智能手机突然被安装了从没见过的游戏，其名为《怪物弹珠》。他带着从手机中飞向现实世界的怪物，在街道中展开了战斗！经过战斗，莲注意到了在自己体内沉睡的谜之记忆的正体，以及，怪物弹珠究竟是何物。与握有钥匙的水泽葵、影月明、若叶皆实一起，如今的莲正迈出通往谜团的一步，对于前方沉睡着无法想象的真相一事，仍然一无所知。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:59:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L9KbbgSgqa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DvNxCWgyhJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9fQ9DESnvg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VnWXVgRZV61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hZTsaeAkFr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UYukVHkYrf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TurwBj41nz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3UVst9W3u31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x1esDbqT6x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p4nAGKQ3G61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2HxnKk6hBC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kjUYZ0BA1t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FT9jtih2631/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qrQ3tLmm8m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.